  <item>
    <title>【012】聊聊杨紫得视后：别在“大女主剧”里抢戏，女演员好了市场才会好</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a426e3b2e335a35a80b50c3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a426e3b2e335a35a80b50c3</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Jun 2026 17:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见！《西拉东扯》终于回归啦！ 前几天2026年白玉兰奖揭晓，杨紫凭借现实主义正剧《生命树》中的女警“白菊”一角，历经4次提名，终于斩获白玉兰最佳女主角！远在西班牙的米拉在下午看直播时紧张得像看高考成绩，而听到这个消息的朋友们纷纷送上两个字——“值得”。</span></p><p><span>从艺30年，作为首位90后白玉兰视后，杨紫的这条路走得太不容易。本期节目，贝拉和米拉将一起深度盘点杨紫从“国民闺女”到“顶级流量”，再到“硬核视后”的30年转型之路。我们不仅想聊她的作品和演技，更想聊聊她身上那种低内耗、结果导向的职场进化论，以及内娱对男女演员那抹不平的包容度差距。</span></p><p><span>只要底色是扎实的，在荒芜的职场土壤里，也终能等到“生命树”开花。</span></p><h3><span>⏱️ 本期时间轴与高光内容</span></h3><ul><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">02:05</a></span></strong><span> 近况闲聊：好久不见！我们为什么上半年没怎么聊国产剧？</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="126">02:06</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="283">04:43</a></span></strong><span> 激动人心的白玉兰开奖：在西班牙看直播是种什么体验？为什么大家都觉得杨紫得奖“太值得了”？</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="284">04:44</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="425">07:05</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>【童星的起点】</span></strong><span>：5岁龙套、孝庄秘史，再到12岁爆红的“第一代国民闺女”夏雪。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="426">07:06</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">09:50</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>【转型的阵痛】</span></strong><span>：临开机被换角的尴尬，宋丹丹当年劝退杨紫真的是因为恶意吗？</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="591">09:51</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="803">13:23</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>【神级转型作】</span></strong><span>：《战长沙》胡湘湘！临时顶替却成就了豆瓣9.1分的抗战剧天花板。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="804">13:24</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="886">14:46</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>【拥抱流量的自救】</span></strong><span>：从《青云志》陆雪琪争议聊起——没有流量，演员就真的没有主动权。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="887">14:47</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1124">18:44</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>【邱莹莹的生命力】</span></strong><span>：《欢乐颂》提名白玉兰女配，那些杨紫自己精心设计、赋予角色的高光小细节。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1385">23:05</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>【爆款制造机】</span></strong><span>：《香蜜》与《亲爱的热热爱的》，杨紫为什么能用演技吊打古偶、甚至“疯狂带火男主”？</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1386">23:06</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1633">27:13</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>【长相思的起伏】</span></strong><span>：从前10集迷人的“文小六”，聊到第二季由于“男演员们拎不清”而导致的口碑滑铁卢。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1634">27:14</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1873">31:13</a></span></strong><span> 行业大吐槽：为什么所有在大女主剧里抢戏、抢番位的男明星最后都lo了？</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1874">31:14</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a></span></strong><span> 影视剧防雷指南：坚决抵制靠“削弱女主智商”来给男主附魔的降智编剧！我们需要势均力敌的双强。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2181">36:21</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2333">38:53</a></span></strong><span> 拼命三娘杨紫：从《国色芳华》收视冠军，聊到穿着戏服走红毯的极度敬业。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2334">38:54</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2639">43:59</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>【今夜生命树开花】</span></strong><span>：深度安利2026开年剧王《生命树》！女警白菊从20岁到中年的眼神变化有多绝？狠狠反驳豆瓣黑子的无脑挑刺。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2865">47:45</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>【明星杨紫的自我要求】</span></strong><span>：面对“不够美、土、整容”的刻薄攻击，她是如何在身材和穿搭上完成自我进化的？</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2866">47:46</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2941">49:01</a></span></strong><span> 女性守望相助：杨紫在直播中主动帮扶青海藏区素人演员、黄灿灿眼中的大明星真性情。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2942">49:02</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3031">50:31</a></span></strong><span> 愤怒与反思：为什么内娱对有道德瑕疵的男明星和女明星，包容度天差地别？</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3032">50:32</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3186">53:06</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>【遗珠推荐】</span></strong><span>：除了《战长沙》，我们为什么强烈推荐你去看被低估的《女心理师》？那个震撼人心的反性侵单元案。</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>【本期提到的剧集】</span></strong><span> 《生命树》《战长沙》《家有儿女》《欢乐颂》《香蜜沉沉烬如霜》《亲爱的，热热爱的》《长相思》《国色芳华》《女心理师》《翘楚》</span><br><span>片尾曲 《我》蔡依林</span><br></p>]]></description>
