    <pubDate>Sun, 02 Mar 2025 21:59:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>当偶像剧把女性困境包装成糖衣炮弹，当亲情剧用东亚式沉默捅刀观众，当20年前的东北草根故事吊打2024“伪现实”悬浮剧——我们究竟在影视剧里消费幻想，还是照见自己？</span><strong><br><span>《童话故事下集》：浪漫爱的陷阱？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> </span><strong><span>浪漫爱的叙事</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>用「一生一世一双人」的偶像剧包装，合理化女性在婚姻中的困境</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>精神出轨真的不能被原谅吗？还是我们被「完美爱情」的假象洗脑了？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> </span><strong><span>《180天重启计划》：东亚家庭的亲情之刀</span></strong></h3><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>东亚家庭里不敢表达爱的真实困境</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>那些说不出口的「我爱你」，藏在每一顿饭和每一次沉默里</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> </span><strong><span>东北幽默的草根故事</span></strong><span>《马大帅》《乡村爱情》</span></h3><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>东北式幽默，草根人物的真实生活</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>陈旧的叙事结构怎么还有这么多受众</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4020">67:00</a> </span><strong><span>2025新剧推荐</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>难哄</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>仙台有树</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>掌心</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4560">76:00</a> </span><strong><span>爽剧大合集</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>如果爽剧不爽，你还会看吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>近期爽剧盘点：《学习小组》《外伤急救中心》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>片头：张万兔 - surprise漫长的季节桦林舞王马队专属恰恰（AI孙燕姿）</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：毛不易-东北民谣</span></p>]]></description>
