    <pubDate>Mon, 10 Feb 2025 13:52:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>！！！本期节目涉及剧透！！！（shownote由AI生成）</span></strong><br><span>💔 春节档の「消失的她」观察报告</span></p><span></span><p><span>1️⃣ 「老登宇宙」の全面入侵： 油腻老男人互搏、青涩男孩成长史…女性角色沦为推进剧情的工具人，甚至「功能性母亲」（妈妈死了才能爆发的哪吒？）</span></p><span></span><p><span>2️⃣ 伪女性主义の千层套路： 古偶剧给大女主披上「独立」披风，却暗搓搓要求她们既要当战神又要守女德</span></p><span></span><p><span>✨ 但总有人用镜头在讲述：《国色芳华》里无法摆脱婚恋世俗束缚的胜意 &nbsp;《异人之下》里陈朵的自我探索</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔥 我们吵吵更健康</span></p><span></span><p><span>▶️ 当资本把「女性向」变成财富密码：</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 是进步还是新型规训？</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 女性主义标签化≠真平等</span></p><span></span><p><span>▶️ 我们想去电影院看什么的电影，怎样才能感觉不被骗：</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 好故事？</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 极致的视听效果？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 哪吒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">05:45</a> 唐探1900</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a> 封神2</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 射雕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a> 过往春节档电影&amp;贾玲导演&amp;圈钱电影（综艺电影、搞笑片）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">31:50</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;《国色芳华》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2300">38:20</a> 《异人之下2》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2680">44:40</a> 《团建不能停》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2920">48:40</a> 期待的影视综《掌心》《六姊妹》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> 大s</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：张万兔 - surprise漫长的季节桦林舞王马队专属恰恰（AI孙燕姿）</span><br><span>片尾： Sufjan Stevens-Mystery of Love &nbsp;&nbsp;‧ 2017</span></p>]]></description>
